{"about_the_game":"<strong>The game is still in a very early Early Access version. </strong><br>We would therefore be very happy if you could share your ideas and suggestions for improvement with us so that we can optimize the game experience.<br>We have an extra channel on our Discord server for this purpose.<br><br><strong>Astronomics Rise of a new Empire</strong> is a easy to learn space real time global strategy(4X) game in which you'll create a new empire. Choose your path, whether you support the rebellion against the Eternal Empire, form a trade alliance, join the pirates or seek domination of the galaxy, only you decide.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Planet Management</h2>Control your planet, the population of your planet is divided into 3 classes with 2 subclasses each. <br>Issue directives and increase the growth of your population, but you should not neglect their satisfaction, because otherwise it can quickly come to an uprising.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982950/extras/PlanetManagement.gif?t=1708188391\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trade Routes</h2>Build a network of trade routes between the planets to boost your faction's economy. <br>You need different materials to produce the components for your fleet in your factories.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982950/extras/Trade_Routes.gif?t=1708188391\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Espionage</h2>Send spies to the planets of your enemies and allies to keep up to date with their actions. <br>If you need to sabotage a factory or eliminate a politician, it is advisable to have an experienced agent at hand.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982950/extras/Espionage.gif?t=1708188391\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diplomacy</h2>Dive into the complex diplomacy system and conduct negotiations with other factions, make agreements, alliances or prepare your alliance for war.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982950/extras/Diplomacy.gif?t=1708188391\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ship Design</h2>In Astronomics Rise of a new Empire you'll create your own ship designs that you can then produce in your shipyard. <br>Build your own fleet to subjugate the galaxy.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982950/extras/ShipDesign.gif?t=1708188391\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Conquest</h2>Destroy your enemies' fleets and conquer their planets. Astronomics Rise of a new Empire offers a complex combat system with which you'll be able to engage in battle against your enemies.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982950/extras/Conquer.gif?t=1708188391\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Politics</h2>Each of your planets has a governor and 6 ministers, these are subordinate to only one, namely your faction leader. <br>But how you fill these positions is up to you, you have different politicians at your disposal, but they all have different ambitions and goals.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982950/extras/Politics.gif?t=1708188391\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Research</h2>Explore new technologies and discover the wonders of the galaxy.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982950/extras/Research.gif?t=1708188391\" />","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Your own Faction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1982950/7d4239093f5669be99d23ec647b07e4c8218a556.jpg"},{"name":"Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1982950/6d58c72f9e10a98bc7896dbe11475fdffa81dcf9.jpg"},{"name":"Ruler of the Galaxy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1982950/9efd44aed5352bddffb26123416deb3b21b73a60.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1982950?t=1708188391","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1708188391","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982950/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1708188391","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982950/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1708188391","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD SERVER</h1><p>","developers":["JayFiArts"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1982950/header.jpg?t=1708188391","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256993669,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256993669/movie480.mp4?t=1707514042","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256993669/movie_max.mp4?t=1707514042"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256993669/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1707514042","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256993669/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1707514042","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256993669/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1707514042"}}],"name":"Astronomics Rise of a New Empire","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default